**Holders (production):**

| Component | Field | Wiring |
|---|---|---|
| **`APIV1Service`** | `MarkdownService markdown.Service` | Set in `NewAPIV1Service` (`server/router/api/v1/v1.go:35`) |
| **`RSSService`** | `MarkdownService markdown.Service` | Same instance passed from `server/server.go:85` |

