```

**Also worth noting:** `memopayload.Runner` declares a `MarkdownService markdown.Service` field (`server/runner/memopayload/runner.go`), but `memopayload.NewRunner` is not called from production server startup. Memo processing instead passes the interface into `memopayload.RebuildMemoPayload(..., s.MarkdownService)` from `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go`.

**Not a separate `Service` impl:** `renderer.MarkdownRenderer` in `internal/markdown/renderer/markdown_renderer.go` is used internally by `RenderMarkdown` and `RenameTag`; it is not behind `markdown.Service`.

No other types implement `markdown.Service` in non-test code.
